  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest accuracy so far. This experiment tests whether replacing resnet50 with the more advanced imagenet_vit_l image encoder while retaining transformer aggregation and weighted fusion could further improve performance. It isolates the impact of the image encoder choice on validation accuracy, building on the strong foundation of config_033 while exploring a key design decision with potential for significant gains."  
